### MediTriaje 2.0 — Colección de Pruebas HTTP (Fase F2.5)
### Acceso Clínico de Emergencia (Break-Glass) — ADR-017
### Compatible con REST Client (VS Code, IntelliJ, etc.)
### Cumplimiento estricto: ADR-002, ADR-003, ADR-007, ADR-008, ADR-011, ADR-012, ADR-017

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@csrfHeader = X-Requested-With
@csrfValue = XMLHttpRequest

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Healthcheck Técnico
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name ping
GET {{baseUrl}}/ping
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Autenticación y Credenciales de Prueba Multi-Rol
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Login como Administrador (ROLE_ADMINISTRADOR)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfValue}}

{
  "email": "admin@meditriaje.com",
  "password": "Admin12345*"
}

### 2.2 Registro de Paciente 1 (Carlos Pérez)
# @name registrarPaciente1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "tipoDocumento": "CC",
  "numeroDocumento": "1098765432",
  "nombres": "Carlos",
  "apellidos": "Perez Gomez",
  "fechaNacimiento": "1992-08-15",
  "telefono": "3109876543",
  "email": "carlos.perez@example.com",
  "password": "PasswordSegura123*",
  "consentimientoTextoVersion": "v1.0",
  "aceptaConsentimiento": true
}

### 2.3 Login Paciente 1
# @name loginPaciente1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
{{csrfHeader}}: {{csrfValue}}

{
  "email": "carlos.perez@example.com",
  "password": "PasswordSegura123*"
}

